			"notes": "Fix on top of v0.4.3. Same requirements: **Petrolpark's Library 1.5.0+** and **JEI 19.39.0.370+**.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Vat thermometer / barometer lose their redstone settings** (#8) — placing or removing a block in front of a gauge switches it to its blocked (redstone output) variant and back, and each switch reset the configured thresholds to their defaults. The thresholds now survive the switch.\n\n## Note on JEI molecule icons (#9)\n\nBy default Destroy shows every molecule in JEI and EMI as the same generic icon. To see the 3D structures, set `fancyJEIRendering = true` under `[chemistry]` in `config/destroy-client.toml`."
