			"notes": "Fixes and additions on top of v0.4.0. Same requirements as 0.4.0: **Petrolpark's Library 1.5.0+** and **JEI 19.39.0.370+**.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Extrusion die** — solid blocks can be extruded again. The die had lost its no-collision property, so a contraption carrying a solid block (quartz, purpur, cordite) stopped dead against it and the recipe never ran. Only the two molten blocks still worked, because they are tagged `movable_empty_collider` and so never collide with anything while moving.\n- **Pollution on Sable ships** — fixed a server crash when growing a tree on a ship (Create's tree fertilizer, bone meal, anything that fires the tree-grow event). Chunk pollution now skips positions whose chunk cannot be reached; some chunk sources throw rather than return null for a position they do not own.\n\n## Textures\n\n- New textures for the bubble cap, centrifuge, pumpjack and tree tap.\n\n## Language\n\n- Japanese translation updates — thanks to [@rit3776](https://github.com/rit3776).\n- Fixed the English definition of syngas: it is a mixture of carbon **monoxide** and hydrogen, not carbon dioxide — thanks to [@rit3776](https://github.com/rit3776)."
		},
