			"notes": "## Requires\n\n- **Petrolpark's Library 1.5.0+** and **JEI 19.39.0.370+**. This update follows the library's 1.5.0 refactor and will not load against older library builds.\n\n## Library 1.5.0 migration\n\nPetrolpark's Library 1.5.0 moved its whole package (`com.petrolpark` → `petrolpark.mc.library`) and renamed **Contaminants → Flags**. Every reference, the fireproof flag data pack, and its lang keys were migrated, and the dependency range is now `[1.5.0,1.6.0)`.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Extended inventory** — fixed a crash when the extra (Creatine) slots were rebuilt after changing dimension or respawning.\n- **Rendering** — fixed a hard `Not building!` crash rendering the pumpjack or mechanical sieve with Flywheel off.\n- **Periodic table** — fixed a crash when a block was placed against a periodic table by something other than a player (e.g. a Ballistix falling block).\n- **JEI category titles** — Fireproofing and the other Destroy categories are named and searchable again after the library changed its category-title key format.\n- **Custom explosive mix** — the `fill_custom_explosive_mix_item` crafting recipe now loads (its serializer was never registered).\n- **Farmer's Delight** — fixed the onion cutting-board recipe format.\n- **Tags** — fixed several broken cross-mod tags (hefty beetroots, Create Big Cannons gas masks, sandstone / netherrack)."
		},
