			"notes": "Fixes and small additions on top of v0.3.9.\n\n## Vat\n- Fixed an explosion when pumping liquid into a nearly-full vat — sub-mB liquid was being folded into the gas phase and rescaled into the tiny remaining headspace, spiking the pressure past any wall's limit.\n- Fixed a VRAM-exhausting GPU crash (no log, could reboot the machine) when standing in vat vent smoke under shaders: evaporation-particle lifetime was unbounded and the fluid box could be drawn far outside the vat.\n- Fixed self-pumping a vat into itself lowering its gas pressure (fill/drain headspace off-by-one).\n- Throttled vent smoke so standing in the cloud no longer tanks FPS.\n\n## Custom Explosive Mix\n- Placed blocks now show their anvil-set name and dye colour. Both crafting-table dyeing and right-click-with-dye work again — the item is now in `#minecraft:dyeable`, which 1.21 requires both for the crafting recipe and for `DyedItemColor.applyDyes`.\n- Colour and name now sync to the client and re-mesh live (no break-and-replace needed).\n- Undyed item no longer renders fully transparent.\n- Menu edits now save and sync — creative pick-block no longer copies an empty inventory.\n\n## JEI\n- Datapack-defined reactions now show up when you focus a molecule.\n- A molecule no longer lists the same reaction twice.\n\n## Other\n- Dynamite: the per-face excavation-radius value box now renders on hover.\n- Circuit board: fixed the copper overlay z-fighting the base in 3D (held / item frame). Circuit patterns and datapack vat materials now sync to players joining a running server (previously blank until `/reload`).\n- `destroy:gas_mask` now protects against Create Big Cannons gas clouds.\n- Fixed saddle, horse-armor and siphon recipes showing an empty tag (`c:leather` -> `c:leathers`, `c:glass` -> `c:glass_blocks`).\n- Fixed the distillation tower's boiling-point range seed.\n- Fixed the Baby Blue syringe tooltip showing \"Format error\" (unescaped `%`).\n- Added trimethyl borate synthesis."
		}
